Approach 1: Intent-Based Stacking: Reduces cognitive load; users know where to go for what.
Description:: Group carousels by type (Utility → Live → Editorial → Short-form).
User Stories
As a busy dad, I want Continue Watching at the top so I can instantly resume last night’s game.
As a casual fan, I want Upcoming Games grouped so I can set recordings without scrolling.
Use Cases
Morning check: see “Upcoming Games,” set a reminder.
Evening: tap “Continue Watching” to resume immediately.
Pros
Clear hierarchy by function.
Easy to scale.
Reinforces habitual patterns.
Cons
Rigid ordering may bury high-value live content.
Risk of visual fatigue.


KPIs
Session starts via top-anchored Utility.
Completion rate in Continue Watching.
Reminder set rate from Upcoming Games.

