Approach 3: Contextual Programming with Priority Slots. Aligns with temporal context and user needs at different times of day/week.

Description: Carousels shift position by temporal context (e.g., Live floats higher during game time, Utility floats down).
User Stories
As a commuter, I want Today’s Games surfaced in the morning so I can plan my evening.
As a fan, I want Live games prioritized during play so I don’t miss out

Use Cases
7pm → Live moves mid-stack into top slot.
Next morning → Recap highlights appear above Editorial.
Pros
Always relevant.
Creates expectation of freshness.
Flexes with sports calendar.
Cons
Potential disorientation as rows “move.”
Operational complexity.
KPIs
DAU uplift from morning/evening check-ins.
More live watch sessions during game time.
Strong highlight engagement next day.

