Approach 4: Anchor + Rotational Model: Create a reliable mental model with room for flexibility.
Description: 2–3 anchor carousels (Utility top, Live mid, Short-form lower). All others rotate programmatically beneath.
User Stories
As a repeat user, I want some carousels always fixed so I don’t lose my bearings.
As a discovery-oriented fan, I want variety below anchors so I keep finding new things.

Use Cases
Utility anchors assure consistency (Continue Watching always top 3).
Editorial rotates for freshness.

Pros
Predictable anchors build trust.
Balance of structure + freshness.
Lower risk of clutter.

Cons
Some content buried if not anchored.
Needs clear rotation logic.
KPIs
Retention from anchors.
Content spread from rotation.
Improved session depth.

